# WFORMTS.KEY - the dialogs' place (WDLG.H) over the frame where it
# starts, maximized, and moved past the screen's top left and bottom
# right corners; then, the frame at the bottom right, a popup larger
# than the screen, and a popup over the frame minimized; the title never
# marked OFF, and the driver checking each dialog;
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTS.SNP.
K F6
K ESC
S START
K ALT-SPACE X
K F6
K ESC
S MAX
K ALT-SPACE R
K HOME
K F6
K ESC
S TOPLEFT
K END
K F6
K ESC
S BOTRIGHT
K PGUP
S LARGE
K PGDN
S ICON
